  "hypothesis": "Four-lane ARM64 NEON modular prefix scans can shorten the horizontal DP dependency chain on obstacle-free spans while preserving exact results.",
  "notes": "Each vector addition combines reduced residues, so unsigned 32-bit arithmetic cannot overflow. Obstacles reset the scan carry; scalar tails handle every width. Includes a scalar fallback. Performance and correctness remain for the controller to evaluate.",
